Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:32.22,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Agents tell users: Monid is
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:32.22,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}open source, use that”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what we found out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.62,0:00:03.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,from our users is that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.31,0:00:04.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Right now because of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:05.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,agent, they actually let
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:07.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,their agent to compare
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.15,0:00:08.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,you with your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:09.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,competitors and let the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.39,0:00:10.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,agent to tell them which
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:11.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,one is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:13.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,I heard of that from our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:14.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,users all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.89,0:00:15.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,They use us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:16.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,they also use our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.73,0:00:17.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:18.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,And when the agent tells
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:20.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,them the results
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:21.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,actually if you're open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:21.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,source and all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.99,0:00:23.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,or how much stars you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:24.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,have on GitHub
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:25.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,it's kind of like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:27.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,showing up like in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:28.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,results and they would
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.33,0:00:29.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,tell their human beings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,that oh Monid is open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:31.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,source so you probably
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:32.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,can use that
